{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Stampora 是一款在 PDF 上加入仿真印章的工具，適合需要為文件加上「已批核」、「機密」或「付款待處理」等標記的行政人員、自由工作者與小型團隊。它提供 25 款可編輯模板，亦可自行設計印章，所有處理均在本機完成，無需帳號或上傳檔案。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-188.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>仿真印章自由加蓋</h2>\n<p>選好印章後，可拖到任何頁面、文字或圖片上方，以觸控手柄移動、縮放與旋轉，亦可輸入準確位置與角度。內置 25 款可編輯模板，另可自訂圓形、橢圓印章，調整墨色、字體與透明度；把紙上簽名拍照，自動移除紙張背景，即成透明印章。印章會直接寫入 PDF，不壓平頁面，原檔不被修改，全程離線運作。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-177-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-178-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-179-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-180-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-181-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-182-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Stampora – Stamp &amp; Sign PDFs</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/stampora-stamp-sign-pdfs/id6823309259?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T01:17:22.533461+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T01:02:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:00:27.271195+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T01:10:45.735094+00:00","content_hash":"588c7c5aa950555f10d7f9a59d4a755b899bd4854a009216972d8fdf852c40e1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}